Flask Limiter Rate Throttler

Implements request rate limiting based on IP address, user ID, or custom request attributes.

Decorators:
  @limiter.limit      Enforces specific request caps per time window (e.g., '10 per minute')
  @limiter.exempt     Bypasses rate limit checks for specified blueprint routes
  @limiter.request_filter Custom callable to conditionally skip rate limiting logic
